{"title":"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">2007 AMC 12B #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 10B Problems\">2007 AMC 10B #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Isabella's house has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> bedrooms. Each bedroom is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet long, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> feet wide, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> feet high. Isabella must paint the walls of all the bedrooms. Doorways and windows, which will not be painted, occupy <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> square feet in each bedroom. How many square feet of walls must be painted? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/d/2fd44a45ee72fa352c83934a103488829ec5fdfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 678 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ 768 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ 786 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ 867 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ 876$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"432\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>There are four walls in each bedroom (she can't paint floors or ceilings). Therefore, we calculate the number of square feet of walls there is in one bedroom:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/3/31353e229cf81ff75c2ec4f126826a7b24eb31b6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\cdot(12\\cdot8+10\\cdot8)-60=2\\cdot176-60=292\\]\" width=\"344\" height=\"18\" />\nWe have three bedrooms, so she must paint <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/45579305b141f8fd877df9f8f660c6bb43fbdac3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$292\\cdot3=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E) }876}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"148\" height=\"30\" /> square feet of walls.\n</p><p>~MathFun1000\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B\">2007 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First question</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 12B